      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "# SD 1.5 Image → Prompt → Image (Pro)\n\n1. **Caption**: PixAI tags + Qwen3-VL write the positive/negative prompt from your photo.\n2. **Base pass** at SD 1.5 native size (~0.4 MP, photo shape) with **FreeU V2** and **Perturbed-Attention Guidance** for cleaner detail and structure at CFG 5.5.\n3. **Hires fix in pixel space**: 4x-UltraSharp, scaled to 2x, then a 0.4-denoise refine pass. Sharper than latent upscaling.\n4. **FaceDetailer** (face_yolov8m + SAM) re-draws faces at 512 px. Turn it off with *Skip face detailer* on the phone.\n\nUse SD 1.5 checkpoints and LoRAs only (`SD15\\` folder). Clip skip 2."
      ],
      "title": "SD 1.5 Pro pipeline — read first"
    },
