      "flags": {},
      "order": 15,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# MODEL FAMILY: STABLE DIFFUSION 1.5\n\n**Compatible model examples / model location:**\nlimitlessvision_v40.safetensors / savMIXSD15_v62.safetensors\n\n**Important:** Select SD 1.5 checkpoints and SD 1.5 LoRAs only; SDXL files are incompatible.\n\n**Ollama caption model vs image model:** In `Qwen3VLAbliteratedPromptPair`, `huihui_ai/qwen3-vl-abliterated:8b-instruct` is an **Ollama image-analysis model**, not your generation checkpoint.\n\n**ComfyUI limitation:** Standard dropdowns still list all matching file types from shared folders; this note and labeled loader indicate what is appropriate, but do not restrict dropdown contents."
      ],
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#161616",
      "title": "MODEL GUIDE — STABLE DIFFUSION 1.5 — READ BEFORE SELECTING"
    },
